sequenceDiagram
    participant D as DiffSystem
    participant C as Client(api.scanDiff)
    participant S as Daemon(server)
    participant H as handleScanDiff
    participant SC as Scanner.scanWithDiff
    participant R as routeDiff(diff.ts)
    participant A as runAnalyzers

    Note over C,S: 基线：daemon 冷扫描填充 L1/L2 + 大文件 IncrementalFileState

    D->>C: DiffInput[] (full | ranges)
    C->>S: scan_diff { config, diffs, options }
    S->>H: handleScanDiff(ctx, config, diffs, options)
    H->>H: 归一化 filePath + 过滤未 discover 文件
    H->>SC: scanWithDiff({ cache, session, pool, diffHints, verifyDiskContent })

    SC->>SC: collectFiles + L1 stat

    loop 每个文件
        alt rel 在 diffHints 中 (变更文件)
            SC->>SC: 读磁盘 content + sha256 校验 (verifyDiskContent)
            SC->>R: resolveDiff(input, oldState=incBucket.get(rel))
            alt byteEqual
                R-->>SC: mode=byteEqual (复用旧结果, 0 parse)
            else incremental
                R-->>SC: mode=incremental + edits
                SC->>A: runAnalyzers(rel, newContent, seed=oldState)
                A-->>SC: { issues, metric }
            else full
                R-->>SC: mode=full
                SC->>A: runAnalyzers(rel, newContent) (无 seed)
                A-->>SC: { issues, metric }
            end
        else 未变文件
            SC->>SC: L1/L2 命中 or 现有 analyze 路径
        end
    end

    SC->>SC: aggregate + issues.sort + buildReport (与冷扫描逐字节一致)
    SC-->>H: { report, stats: DiffStats }
    H-->>S: scan_done { report, stats }
    S-->>C: { report, stats }
    C-->>D: { report, stats }
